  "title": "Crème de Menthe Bars",
  "description": "This is a very easy recipe for crème de menthe bars. Great brownies with a mint-flavored filling.",
  "authors": [
    "Deirdre Dee"
  ],
  "date_published": "1999-04-15T19:34:06-04:00",
